<title>SPAIN: Spain's Gines Navarro, OCP announce merger terms.</title>
<headline>Spain's Gines Navarro, OCP announce merger terms.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction firms Gines Navarro, and OCP Construcciones said on Wednesday they would propose the exchange of one OCP share for three Gines shares to their respective boards in their planned merger.</p>
<p>The two companies announced on Monday that they planned to merge after Spain's stock market watchdog, the CNMV, suspended their shares.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2340</p>
